'''Violent Retaliation''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Gladiator]] that makes your [[attack]] damage [[lucky]] and allows your hits to [[ignore]] the enemy's [[physical damage reduction]] if you've blocked a hit in the past 20 seconds.

==Ruthless mode==
{{infocard2
|header    = Violent Retaliation (Ruthless)
|subheader = Ascendancy Notable Passive Skill
|1         = <div class="passive-icon-container passive-icon-type__ascendancy_notable"><div class="passive-icon-frame"></div>[[File:GLADViolentRetaliation (Gladiator) passive skill icon.png]]</div>
|2         = Attack Damage while Dual Wielding is Lucky if you've Blocked in the past 20 seconds
}}

Violent Retaliation in [[Ruthless mode]] does not let your hits ignore enemy physical damage reduction, and requires [[dual-wielding]] to benefit from the lucky mechanic.

